sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.attendance.show)"
    participant Controller as "Employee AttendanceController"
    participant Model as "Attendance Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Klik detail absensi
    View->>Controller: GET /employee/attendance/{id}
    Controller->>Model: getById(id) + validasi kepemilikan data
    Model->>DB: SELECT attendance + photos + worker-shift
    DB-->>Model: Data detail absensi
    Model-->>Controller: Entitas absensi

    alt Data valid (id milik pegawai login)
        Controller->>View: Render detail absensi
        View-->>Pegawai: Detail check-in/out dan foto tampil
    else Data tidak valid (id tidak ada/tidak berhak akses)
        Controller->>View: 403/redirect + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal melihat detail
    end
